{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56318","headline":"咏萤 · 李嘉运","name":"咏萤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"映水光难定，淩虚体自轻。\n夜风吹不灭，秋露洗还明。\n向烛仍藏焰，投书更有情。\n犹将流乱影，来此傍檐楹。\n（据中华书局影印本《文苑英华》卷三二九及该书新编目录。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷二百六误收作李嘉佑诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉运","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}